flowchart TD
    Start([Start]) --> Open[User opens PROTECT]
    Open --> Access{Public link or staff login?}

    %% Public access
    Access -- Public --> Public[Public Announcements / Needs portal]
    Public --> PublicData[(Announcements + Needs submissions)]

    %% Staff access
    Access -- Staff login --> AuthCheck{Supabase Auth valid?}
    AuthCheck -- No --> Login[Login page]
    AuthCheck -- Yes --> Profile[Fetch user profile + role]
    Profile --> RoleCheck{Role authorized for page?}
    RoleCheck -- No --> Restricted[Access Restricted]
    RoleCheck -- Yes --> Dashboard[Community Dashboard]

    %% Main modules
    Dashboard --> Choose{Select module}
    Choose --> Residents[Resident Profiling]
    Choose --> QR[QR Verification]
    Choose --> Analytics[Population / Poverty / Sector Analytics]
    Choose --> GIS[GIS Household Map]
    Choose --> Crime[Crime & Incident]
    Choose --> Hotspot[Crime Hotspot Map]
    Choose --> Disaster[Disaster Vulnerability]
    Choose --> Beneficiary[Beneficiary Tracking]
    Choose --> Predictive[Predictive Growth]
    Choose --> AnnouncementsAdmin[Announcements Admin]
    Choose --> Reports[DILG Reports]
    Choose --> Users[User Management]
    Choose --> AdminTools[System & Audit]

    %% Data operations for each module
    Residents --> DB[(Residents + Households)]
    QR --> DB
    Analytics --> DB
    GIS --> DB
    Crime --> IncidentData[(Incidents)]
    Hotspot --> IncidentData
    Disaster --> DisasterData[(Risk Zones + Survey Data)]
    Beneficiary --> BenefitData[(Beneficiaries + Programs)]
    Predictive --> DB
    AnnouncementsAdmin --> AnnData[(Announcements)]
    Reports --> DB
    Users --> ProfileData[(Profiles + Roles)]
    AdminTools --> AuditData[(Audit Logs + Backup/Restore)]

    %% Shared backend
    DB --> Backend[Supabase Backend<br/>PostgreSQL · Auth · Storage · RLS]
    IncidentData --> Backend
    DisasterData --> Backend
    BenefitData --> Backend
    AnnData --> Backend
    ProfileData --> Backend
    AuditData --> Backend

    Backend --> Session{Continue session?}
    Session -- Yes --> Dashboard
    Session -- No --> Logout([User logs out])
